vie unless his character retaliated. He even had a clause put into his contract that the scene could never be edited out of the film when it was shown on television or in theaters, ensuring that audiences would always see a Black man standing up for his dignity. Id X, who also became the first African American to win an Oscar for best actor. Id X.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:27Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Sidney", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:31Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Poitier", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:32Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Poitier", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:33Z", "username": "bijal bhatt", "text": "poiter", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:44Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Will give it to KP", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Wasn’t Sal faster?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:52Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Sidney to Lumet bhi hai 😂", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:29:56Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Hahahahahahaha", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:30:00Z", "username": "Abhishek Saluja", "text": "Main poitier hi theek se spell karta reh gaya", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-13T16:30:11Z", "username": "bijal b